{"lines": [{"text": "Why the FBI never found this man.", "start": 0.05, "end": 1.946, "spec": {"type": "hero"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Why", 0.086, 0.194], ["the", 0.194, 0.269], ["FBI", 0.269, 0.603], ["never", 0.614, 0.884], ["found", 0.894, 1.164], ["this", 1.164, 1.282], ["man", 1.293, 1.573]]}, {"text": "In 1971, a quiet man in a suit boarded a flight to Seattle.", "start": 2.046, "end": 6.438, "spec": {"type": "cabin"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In 1971", 0.086, 1.088], ["a", 1.433, 1.487], ["quiet", 1.498, 1.875], ["man", 1.886, 2.144], ["in", 2.155, 2.241], ["a", 2.241, 2.274], ["suit", 2.284, 2.586], ["boarded", 2.586, 2.845], ["a", 2.856, 2.899], ["flight", 2.909, 3.319], ["to", 3.427, 3.502], ["Seattle", 3.513, 4.062]]}, {"text": "He handed the flight attendant a note. He had a bomb.", "start": 6.538, "end": 9.37, "spec": {"type": "note"}, "afx": null, "words": [["He", 0.097, 0.162], ["handed", 0.162, 0.409], ["the", 0.409, 0.463], ["flight", 0.463, 0.83], ["attendant", 0.959, 1.293], ["a", 1.293, 1.304], ["note", 1.315, 1.703], ["He", 2.058, 2.09], ["had", 2.091, 2.177], ["a", 2.177, 2.209], ["bomb", 2.209, 2.511]]}, {"text": "He wanted two hundred thousand dollars, and four parachutes.", "start": 9.47, "end": 12.518, "spec": {"type": "demand"}, "afx": null, "words": [["He", 0.086, 0.129], ["wanted", 0.129, 0.334], ["two", 0.345, 0.506], ["hundred", 0.506, 0.679], ["thousand", 0.69, 0.991], ["dollars", 0.991, 1.455], ["and", 1.627, 1.778], ["four", 1.789, 2.058], ["parachutes", 2.058, 2.716]]}, {"text": "In Seattle, he swapped the passengers for the money.", "start": 12.618, "end": 15.426, "spec": {"type": "runway"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.065, 0.162], ["Seattle", 0.172, 0.679], ["he", 0.991, 1.056], ["swapped", 1.056, 1.412], ["the", 1.412, 1.487], ["passengers", 1.487, 1.994], ["for", 2.004, 2.09], ["the", 2.091, 2.144], ["money", 2.155, 2.489]]}, {"text": "Then, at night, in a storm, he jumped out of the back of the plane.", "start": 15.526, "end": 18.958, "spec": {"type": "jump", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.086, 0.302], ["at", 0.42, 0.528], ["night", 0.528, 0.884], ["in", 1.056, 1.121], ["a", 1.121, 1.164], ["storm", 1.164, 1.638], ["he", 1.853, 1.961], ["jumped", 1.972, 2.274], ["out", 2.284, 2.371], ["of", 2.371, 2.403], ["the", 2.403, 2.457], ["back", 2.468, 2.715], ["of", 2.716, 2.748], ["the", 2.748, 2.802], ["plane", 2.802, 3.114]]}, {"text": "Nine years later, a boy found five thousand eight hundred dollars of it by a river.", "start": 19.058, "end": 23.69, "spec": {"type": "river"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nine", 0.086, 0.312], ["years", 0.312, 0.55], ["later", 0.55, 0.916], ["a", 1.239, 1.304], ["boy", 1.315, 1.552], ["found", 1.562, 1.886], ["five", 1.897, 2.187], ["thousand", 2.198, 2.64], ["eight", 2.802, 2.899], ["hundred", 2.909, 3.147], ["dollars", 3.147, 3.437], ["of", 3.448, 3.513], ["it", 3.513, 3.631], ["by", 3.642, 3.782], ["a", 3.782, 3.847], ["river", 3.847, 4.31]]}, {"text": "The rest was never found. And neither was he.", "start": 23.79, "end": 26.334, "spec": {"type": "gone"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.086, 0.14], ["rest", 0.14, 0.42], ["was", 0.42, 0.528], ["never", 0.528, 0.787], ["found", 0.787, 1.185], ["And", 1.53, 1.616], ["neither", 1.616, 1.843], ["was", 1.843, 1.961], ["he", 1.972, 2.22]]}, {"text": "Would you have jumped?", "start": 26.434, "end": 28.306, "spec": {"type": "end", "choice": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Would", 0.086, 0.162], ["you", 0.162, 0.194], ["have", 0.194, 0.291], ["jumped", 0.291, 0.625]]}], "dur": 28.71}